      "delta": "Caller-owned process: startAcpProcess takes an injected SpawnAcpLineProcess and passes exactly the explicit filtered env and cwd; no executable manager, killTree option or resources reader. The owned process splits stdout into bounded lines; each line goes back to the official ndJsonStream with its newline, and each written message goes through the acknowledged stdin write, so the SDK keeps its own framing, parse-error answers and write order."
