    {
      "path": "shared/acp/session.ts",
      "sourcePath": "packages/oar/src/shared/acp/session.ts",
      "upstreamSha256": "46ed3c3e73c29df0273672ab09d907d128ace09f0824c4fc46e93590d7d04921",
      "vendoredSha256": "60c47a0fb2c369931857f69fc6a4d6ccf63178c4ccc798a2d35bd41976bae6a0",
      "delta": "Raw adapter for the SDK: acpSession(profile) returns a start function that takes the injected agent-process spawn, the injected terminal spawn and a required explicit filtered env (no sessionEnvironment ambient merge). It returns AdapterSession without sealSession/withSessionCredentials, builds one sessionCredentialRedactor per open as the kernel redact hook and for errors from the open path and every control, and takes onReady and onRecord hooks; onRecord is registered as a kernel observer before the recorder binds. A throwing onReady releases the process and the terminal host. The exit observer's terminal disposal is the same one dispose awaits, and a repeated dispose retries a failed terminal reap. No resources reader."
    },
    {
      "path": "shared/acp/terminal.ts",
      "sourcePath": "packages/oar/src/shared/acp/terminal.ts",
      "upstreamSha256": "cd943c545a0b00eb90107434416e9a9c78bc6af2fb3fb11b410244288740faac",
      "vendoredSha256": "b17f25c9469a4210a11e2a5f1b228b917835e1bc8dafff37ae85cb2b7eca5022",
      "delta": "Caller-owned terminal processes: createAcpTerminalHost takes an injected SpawnAcpTerminal that spawns, adopts and reaps each hosted command in the SDK process-tree authority with the session's explicit env plus the request's env entries. terminal/kill asks that tree to stop; release and dispose end the tree and wait for it. A released or disposed terminal stays tracked until its tree is gone. One disposal serves concurrent callers; a failed reap rejects and a later dispose retries every tree still alive. A terminal/create after disposal began is refused. No cross-spawn and no executable manager."
    },
